                    "id": "38b13284-5c09-43e3-906b-dd1ce595a788",
                    "label": "Welcome",
                    "enableOffline": "",
                    "customId": "welcome",
                    "content": "<div class=\"ui-welcome\">\n<h1>Apps and Workflow Made Simple<\/h1>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"icon\" style=\"margin-right: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; float: left; clear: left;\"><img src=\"#request.contextPath#/images/icon_idea.png\" alt=\"Build apps\" width=\"120\" height=\"85\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"message\">\n<h3>Build apps, not just processes!<\/h3>\n<p>Create full-fledged apps with support for data records management.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"icon\" style=\"margin-right: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; float: left; clear: left;\"><img src=\"#request.contextPath#/images/icon_rocket.png\" alt=\"Increased efficiency\" width=\"120\" height=\"85\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"message\">\n<h3>Increased Efficiency and Productivity<\/h3>\n<p>Faster and more consistent completion of manual processes, and with minimal errors.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"icon\" style=\"margin-right: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; float: left; clear: left;\"><img src=\"#request.contextPath#/images/icon_cost.png\" alt=\"Lowered cost\" width=\"120\" height=\"85\"><\/div>\n<div class=\"message\">\n<h3>Lowered Cost<\/h3>\n<p>Employees can be guided through complex procedures, hence reducing the cost of training.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>"
                }
            }],
